        "label": "Excellent",
        "locale": "en_US",
        "rating": 10,
        "text": "Love that we were just a few minutes to the beach. The house accommodated our party of 16. The only thing that needs to be updated are the bedroom arrangements. There is only one room with a queen bed and 2 bunk beds. Other than that we loved it there!",
        "themes": [
