        "verified": true
      },
      {
        "author": "Verified traveler",
        "date": "2024-06-29T12:42:20Z",
        "id": "6680012f66012657534c063d",
        "label": "Excellent",
        "locale": "en_US",
        "rating": 10,
        "text": "Prior renters really were abusive. Obvious they don’t hold to “leave nothing behind”. Especially don’t believe in “leave it better than it was”. What a mess! Too much to detail, but it was bad! Obvious too much the cleaning service to get this beautiful house back in order. \n\nManagement got right on it though. We picked up trash, cleaned up a few things in and out, and got the pool in order. Then we had the best time ever! Will go back if they don’t raise the rent, (like I bet they will). Lot more house than what we paid for!\n\nAnd be more descriptive of the cottage! What a neat little set up for older kids (16+).",
        "themes": [
          "Liked: Check-in, communication, location, listing accuracy"
        ],
        "title": "Rough start, Excellent finish",
